🚀 Hope Reach AI

🌍 AI-Powered Healthcare Assistant for Refugees and Underserved Communities

Welcome to Hope Reach AI, an AI-powered healthcare platform developed to provide accessible, reliable, and educational healthcare information. The application is designed to support refugees, displaced families, students, low-income communities, and anyone seeking trustworthy health guidance through an intelligent and user-friendly web application.


